{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/709673362d5b1adf9af82ad5c8fcb78a.poster.avif?t=1759698543\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/709673362d5b1adf9af82ad5c8fcb78a.webm?t=1759698543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/709673362d5b1adf9af82ad5c8fcb78a.mp4?t=1759698543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Armory Simulator</i>, immerse yourself in the captivating and unforgiving world of the Wild West, where every bullet counts, and every customer has a story to tell. Your mission? Build, manage, and expand your own armory, catering to the needs of cowboys, bounty hunters, and outlaws seeking the finest equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/fdf640f15ad3f9738f457328e87e8d00.poster.avif?t=1759698543\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/fdf640f15ad3f9738f457328e87e8d00.webm?t=1759698543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/fdf640f15ad3f9738f457328e87e8d00.mp4?t=1759698543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co